      "semantic_execution_status": "executable_engine_runtime",
      "source_id": "gw-11e-core-rules:other-concepts:visibility-battlefield-edge-faq",
      "source_text": "VISIBILITY BATTLEFIELD EDGE FAQ\nQ: When a model overhangs the edge of the battlefield, how does that affect its visibility?\nA: That model's controlling player can draw line of sight from any part of that model that is not overhanging the edge of the battlefield. Their opponent can draw line of sight to any part of that model.",
